      "writtenOn": "2024-08-22T09:56:54Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "So we have to decide what we do in this case: \n1) do not allow direct outputs if a deep buffer flag is set in the client request: we need to fix locations where we deep buffer flag is set by the client (for instance for compressed format)\n2) we allow direct outputs even if the deep buffer flag is set by the client.\n\nIn any case, the flags returned to audio flinger must be consistent with the choice made by the APM: if a direct output is selected, the deep buffer flag must be removed whne returning to audio flinger.",
      "parentUuid": "7e36c82b_ba7e3fc3",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 11,
        "startChar": 58,
        "endLine": 11,
        "endChar": 87
      },
      "revId": "84e89f5d0a8b59081fd702048fa94336f28335be",
