      "writtenOn": "2024-08-22T11:47:36Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Agree, probably we need to consider here\n\nDEEP BUFFER FLAG forced by APM itself vs client requesting for DEEP BUFFER.\n\n\n1) For APM forcing deep buffer \n\n* Defer the flag setting\n* First try with directOutput,\n* If available attach to direct\n* If direct is not available then add deep buffer flags, the way this CL is doing.\n\n\n2) Client requested deep buffer\n\n-\u003e I would say if client is explicitly requesting for DEEP buffer, then APM should not provide direct outputs, this is where my other change will be helpful : \n\nhttps://android-review.googlesource.com/c/platform/frameworks/av/+/3206293/3",
